> Hermes uses `.hermes.md` (or `HERMES.md`) at the project
> root as the persistent behavioral instruction surface — it
> is concatenated into the system prompt at session start
> alongside `~/.hermes/SOUL.md`. The persona stays in SOUL.md;
> this file adds the MPM behavioral layer. Edit the canonical
> managed block in
> `~/.mpm/agent_installation/MPM_AGENT_INTEGRATION_SNIPPETS.md`,
> not this file, for behavioral changes.
